1
00:05:47,880 --> 00:05:53,440
In the future, I think it will be more common with journalists-

2
00:05:53,600 --> 00:06:00,040
-Or focusing on areas they know well and receives revenue directly from the reader.

3
00:06:00,200 --> 00:06:05,560
It becomes important for us consumers to be critically set-

4
00:06:05,720 --> 00:06:11,360
-And critically consume this type of independent journalists.

5
00:06:11,520 --> 00:06:16,760
Is this reporter an expert, credible or bought?

6
00:06:16,920 --> 00:06:22,040
Is it sponsored?
We have to get better at seeing it.

7
00:06:22,200 --> 00:06:28,680
A world grows where both you and your readers can fit.

8
00:06:28,840 --> 00:06:34,960
It becomes more important how journalists act.
Are they professional?

9
00:06:35,120 --> 00:06:42,480
Do they stick to facts without personal opinions coloring the reports?
